From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:08:14 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] contrib: gtactive3: the repository is
 exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3

Renamed from samsung-gtactive3wifi on 2026-11-11 (it is the port of the
whole Galaxy Tab Active3 family now). The default update address of the
image hook follows; CI passes the address from config.toml anyway, and
images with the old one still update through GitHub's redirect.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 contrib/samsung-gtactive3/firmware/APKBUILD | 2 +-
 contrib/samsung-gtactive3/mkosi.finalize    | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/firmware/APKBUILD b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/firmware/APKBUILD
index 6d04e30..3dbb613 100644
--- a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/firmware/APKBUILD
+++ b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/firmware/APKBUILD
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ pkgname=firmware-samsung-gtactive3wifi
 pkgver=20251001
 pkgrel=0
 pkgdesc="Samsung Galaxy Tab Active3 vendor firmware (local build, not redistributable)"
-url="https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3wifi"
+url="https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3"
 arch="noarch"
 license="proprietary"
 options="!check !strip !tracedeps !archcheck"
diff --git a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/mkosi.finalize b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/mkosi.finalize
index 980e0aa..c3cd83d 100755
--- a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/mkosi.finalize
+++ b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3/mkosi.finalize
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 # drivers on top of the postmarketOS packages) as GitHub releases, one
 # release per update channel:
 #
-#   https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3wifi/releases/download/
+#   https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3/releases/download/
 #       samsung-gtactive3wifi_<ui>_<release><suffix>/SHA256SUMS(.gpg)
 #
 # so sysupdate here must never fetch postmarketOS's generic images (they
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@
 set -eu
 
 HERE=$(cd "$(dirname "$(readlink -f "$0")")" && pwd)
-BASE=${GTA3_UPDATE_BASE:-https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3wifi/releases/download/}
+BASE=${GTA3_UPDATE_BASE:-https://github.com/exynos-linux/samsung-gtactive3/releases/download/}
 case "$PMOS_DEVICE" in
 samsung-gtactive3wifi) CHFILE=${GTA3_CHANNEL_FILE:-/usr/lib/gtactive3wifi/update-channel} ;;
 *) CHFILE=${GTA3_CHANNEL_FILE:-/usr/lib/$PMOS_DEVICE/update-channel} ;;
-- 
2.53.0

